      "title": "Dark Matter Labs Theme",
      "description": "Matched to dm.sh: cool blue-tinted (240°) near-black dark theme, dark-by-default. Destructive red is the only product hue. Rounded corners, ring-1 hairline elevation. Inter + Monaspace Neon + Montserrat.",
